OL,3,GNEWSAMarket and town halls: Historic
OL,4,Asites being left to ruin
OL,5,
OL,6,FHistoric buildings dating back to
OL,7,FAnglo-Saxon and Roman times make up key
OL,8,Flandmarks across the West of England,
OL,9,Fattracting thousands of tourists every
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FBut maintaining them can be expensive
OL,13,Fand two new sites in our region have
OL,14,Fbeen placed on Historic England's
OL,15,FHeritage at-risk register.
OL,17,FAcross England, there are close to
OL,18,F5,000 buildings, places of worship,
OL,19,Farchaeological sites and protected
OL,20,Fwreck sites on the register, which
OL,21,Fshows they are at risk of neglect,
OL,22,Fdecay or inappropriate change.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
